    <p>
      We also need to decide what happens if no sequence satisfies the
      constraint. A controller cannot quietly pretend it found a safe option.
      Depending on the application, it might stop, enter a defined fallback
      mode, request human authorization, or gather more information. The
      right response is part of the system design, not a footnote to the
      optimizer.
    </p>

